{"headword":"חָפַר","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. dig, search for (</strong>Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">حَفَرَ</span> <em>id.;</em> Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲפַר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܦܰܪ</span>, <em>id.;</em> NH <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵפֶר</span> <em>act of digging</em><strong>)</strong>—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 39:29\" href=\"/Job.39.29\">Jb 39:29</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְחָפַרְתָּ֫</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 11:18\" href=\"/Job.11.18\">Jb 11:18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְחָפַרְתָּ֫ה</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 23:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.23.14\">Dt 23:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חָפַרְתִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:30\" href=\"/Genesis.21.30\">Gn 21:30</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חָֽפְרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:18\" href=\"/Genesis.26.18\">Gn 26:18</a> + 2 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">חָפָ֑רוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:32\" href=\"/Genesis.26.32\">Gn 26:32</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲפָרוּהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:18\" href=\"/Numbers.21.18\">Nu 21:18</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיַּחְפֹּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:18\" href=\"/Genesis.26.18\">Gn 26:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:22\" href=\"/Genesis.26.22\">22</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיַּחְפִּרֵהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 7:16\" href=\"/Psalms.7.16\">ψ 7:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וָאֶחְפֹּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.7\">Je 13:7</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יַחְפְּדוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 39:21\" href=\"/Job.39.21\">Jb 39:21</a> (but read <span dir=\"rtl\">יַחְפֹּר</span> so 𝔊 𝔙 𝔖 Di) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 1:22\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.1.22\">Dt 1:22</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיַּחְפְּרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:19\" href=\"/Genesis.26.19\">Gn 26:19</a> + 2 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיַּחְפְּרֻהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 3:21\" href=\"/Job.3.21\">Jb 3:21</a>; Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">לַחְפֹּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 2:2\" href=\"/Joshua.2.2\">Jos 2:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 2:3\" href=\"/Joshua.2.3\">3</a> + <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 2:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.2.20\">Is 2:20</a> (cf. infr.); Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹפֵר</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 10:8\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.10.8\">Ec 10:8</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>dig:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"a well, c. acc. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּאֵר</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:30\" href=\"/Genesis.21.30\">Gn 21:30</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:15\" href=\"/Genesis.26.15\">26:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:18\" href=\"/Genesis.26.18\">18</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:19\" href=\"/Genesis.26.19\">19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:21\" href=\"/Genesis.26.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:22\" href=\"/Genesis.26.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:32\" href=\"/Genesis.26.32\">32</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:18\" href=\"/Numbers.21.18\">Nu 21:18</a> (E); cf. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 7:24\" href=\"/Exodus.7.24\">Ex 7:24</a> (E); <em>dig</em> (a hole, implied as obj.) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 23:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.23.14\">Dt 23:14</a>; a pit, with hostile purpose, as snare or trap, fig. of malicious plan, c. acc. <span dir=\"rtl\">בּוֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 7:16\" href=\"/Psalms.7.16\">ψ 7:16</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּרָה</span>); so c. acc. <span dir=\"rtl\">גומץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 10:8\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.10.8\">Ec 10:8</a>, cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ לְנַפְשִׁי [שַׁחַת]</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 35:7\" href=\"/Psalms.35.7\">ψ 35:7</a>; of horse, <em>dig</em>, i.e. <em>paw</em> the ground, <span dir=\"rtl\">יַחְפֹּר בָּעֵמֶק</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 39:21\" href=\"/Job.39.21\">Jb 39:21</a> (so read, v. supr.) <em>he paweth in the valley</em> (cf. Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">حَافِرٌ</span> <em>hoof</em>)."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>dig</em> for something hidden, c. acc. <a data-ref=\"Job 3:21\" href=\"/Job.3.21\">Jb 3:21</a> (fig. of longing for death), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.7\">Je 13:7</a> (no obj. expr.)"}],"num":"b."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>search, search out, explore</em>, c. acc. <span dir=\"rtl\">הָאָרֶץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 2:2\" href=\"/Joshua.2.2\">Jos 2:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 2:3\" href=\"/Joshua.2.3\">3</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 1:22\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.1.22\">Dt 1:22</a>; of eagle, <em>search for</em> food, c. acc. <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ אֹכֶל</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 39:29\" href=\"/Job.39.29\">Jb 39:29</a>, with especially reference to keen vision (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵרָחוֹק עֵינָיו יַבִּיטוּ</span>); so = <em>search</em> or <em>look carefully about</em> before going to rest <a data-ref=\"Job 11:18\" href=\"/Job.11.18\">Jb 11:18</a> (no obj.).—<span dir=\"rtl\">לַחְפֹּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 2:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.2.20\">Is 2:20</a> v. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, חֲפַרְפָּרָה\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_חֲפַרְפָּרָה\">חֲפַרְפָּרָה</a> infr."}],"num":"2."}],"form":"Qal"}]},"rid":"BDB03345","strong_numbers":["2658","2659"],"next_hw":"חֵ֫פֶר","prev_hw":"חָפַץ","all_cited":true,"ordinal":"I.","root":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["2916","2917"],"TWOT":["714","715"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}